      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $100x^2-70x-8=(20x+a)(bx+c)$，其中 $a$、$b$、$c$ 均為整數，則下列敘述何者錯誤？"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$b$ 是 $100$ 的因數。",
          "$8$ 是 $c$ 的倍數。",
          "$a$、$c$ 是同號數。",
          "$ab>20c$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "sourceSha256": "c2c18a429d66913df2021d04dfdd74ef40038740fde2918752a7a6e47c9d586b",
    "verified": true
  },
